$772
{"role": "assistant", "content": "The example\u202f`fidelity-profile.json` shown in the documentation lists the following fields, which are the ones referenced by the onboarding playbook:\n\n- **name** \u2013 identifier of the fidelity tier\u3010chunk-19\u3011  \n- **quantization** \u2013 e.g.,\u202f`int8`\u202f\u3010chunk-19\u3011  \n- **max_batch_tokens** \u2013 maximum tokens per batch (e.g.,\u202f2048)\u3010chunk-19\u3011  \n- **kv_cache_policy** \u2013 cache eligibility setting (e.g.,\u202f`warm-eligible`)\u3010chunk-19\u3011  \n- **fallback_variant** \u2013 name of the fallback fidelity tier (e.g.,\u202f`high-fidelity-A`)\u3010chunk-19\u3011\n\nNo additional fields from the onboarding checklist or sign\u2011off rubric are present in the provided context."}
