$980
{"role": "assistant", "content": "The pragmatic onboarding playbook is built around a few core principles:\n\n* **Map customer SLOs to fidelity tiers** \u2013\u202fit ties latency, availability and correctness requirements to the appropriate SLO\u2011driven fidelity tier.  \n* **Define required telemetry** \u2013\u202fthe playbook specifies the telemetry needed to verify those SLOs.  \n* **Perform operational checks** \u2013\u202fit lists the checks that must be run before and after onboarding.  \n* **Follow a step\u2011by\u2011step checklist** \u2013\u202fboth commercial and technical leads use a detailed checklist to guide the process.  \n* **Apply the playbook to specific use\u2011cases** \u2013\u202fit is intended for contracting dedicated or private deployments and for migrating high\u2011usage tenants from hosted to dedicated environments.  \n\nThese principles are described in the document\u2019s overview of the pragmatic onboarding playbook\u202f[chunk-2]."}
