$681
{"role": "assistant", "content": "The pragmatic onboarding playbook is built around a few core principles:\n\n1. **Map customer\u2011defined SLOs (latency, availability, correctness) to the appropriate fidelity tier.**  \n2. **Define and collect the required telemetry for each tier.**  \n3. **Perform operational checks to validate the mapping and telemetry.**  \n4. **Provide a step\u2011by\u2011step checklist that guides both commercial and technical leads through the onboarding process.**  \n5. **Apply the playbook when contracting dedicated or private deployments and when migrating high\u2011usage tenants from hosted to dedicated environments.**\u202f[chunk-2][chunk-1]"}
