$519
{"role": "assistant", "content": "The pragmatic playbook lists three principles:\n\n1. **SLOs lead decisioning** \u2013 fidelity choices (quantization, model variant, batching) must be selected to meet the agreed\u2011upon SLO window, not the reverse.  \n2. **Measure before change** \u2013 collect seven days of representative telemetry before finalizing any package.  \n3. **Guardrails** \u2013 automated quality checks (e.g., sample prompts) must pass before enabling lower\u2011cost fidelity modes.  \n\n[chunk-6]"}
